WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.867
SOLID. A stone keeps its shape beside a bowl.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.888
LIQUID. Water flows from a jug into a cup.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.717
GAS. Air fills a balloon and makes it larger.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.296
SORT. Stone equals solid; water equals liquid; air equals gas.
